 <COL N="0689B"></COL> urbem vocat, lib. XXXVII, p. 54,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Brigavntion povlin
allaikivaû parapleuvsaû,</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Brigantium, urbem Callaeciae,
