a parte septentrionis <NOTE N="148." TYPE="Notae" ED="Havercampus, Sigebertus" ANCHORED=Y COM="0689" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0689C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Usque ad.</HI>  Posteriorem vocem delet Lugd.
Bat.</NOTE>  usque ad Cantabros Asturesque
deducunt, atque inde per Vaccaeos et <NOTE N="149." TYPE="Notae" ED="Havercampus, Sigebertus" ANCHORED=Y COM="0689" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0689C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Oretanos.</HI>  Ed. pr.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Oreatanos,</HI>  dein Meus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quos
ab occasu habet positos, in n. m. l. Carthago d.;</HI>  at
ed. pr.  <HI REND="ITALIC">q. a. o. habet positam in n. m. l. Carthaginem
