ab occidente <NOTE N="210." TYPE="Notae" ED="Havercampus, Sigebertus" ANCHORED=Y COM="0695" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0695C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Mari Icario.</HI>  Ed. Aug.  <HI REND="ITALIC">mari Ionio.</HI></NOTE>  mari Icario, a septentrione mari
